# Auth for publishing to GitHub Packages. No token is stored here: npm expands
# ${NPM_GITHUB_TOKEN} when it reads this file, and the Makefile's publish target
# supplies it from the gh CLI for that one process.
#
# npm expands ${VAR} only -- it never invokes a shell, so $(gh auth token) would
# sit here as literal text. The indirection is what keeps the token off disk.
#
# An unset NPM_GITHUB_TOKEN is harmless: this line applies to npm.pkg.github.com
# alone, which nothing here installs from, so ordinary `npm install` is unaffected.
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_GITHUB_TOKEN}
